Android Debug Bridge and BoringSSL SPAKE2 (wire compatibility only)
-------------------------------------------------------------------

src/main/kotlin/io/github/incallagent/rotep/shell/adb/ connects the app to the phone's own adbd
through Wireless debugging. The code is written for this app, but to work it has to follow the wire
formats of the Android Debug Bridge (packages/modules/adb in the Android Open Source Project, Apache
License 2.0) and of the SPAKE2 exchange as BoringSSL implements it (crypto/curve25519/spake25519.c),
including its two fixed points and its handling of the password scalar. No source file, library or
binary of those projects is included in the app.
